  "id": "fig-130",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Exercise 330, whole solved object: retain both independent perspective cases, all source vector directions A to M to N to B and A to B, all labels and four perspective right-angle marks. Case a has the acute directed-vector angle, case b its supplement. No phi arc, equation or new answer is drawn. spatialAt supports a separate 3D check rather than false screen-space perpendicularity.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/9-10g/figures/fig-130.png",
      "sha256": "4d263feab200f4c503c12fab90d75e56d7dc93a733cab6e933f5f8a899bbbaba"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "geo910-c1-s3-n35",
        "exercise": "330",
        "text": "330*. 已知两条异面直线$a$和$b$，它们所成的角等于$\\varphi$；它们的公垂线$[MN]$的长度等于$d$(图130). 在已知直线上分别取点$A$和$B$，且$|MA|=m$，$|NB|=n$. 求$|AB|$.\n解. 如图130所指出的那样，作向量$\\vec{m}$、$\\vec{n}$、$\\vec{d}$. 根据多边形法则，有：\n$\\overrightarrow{AB}=\\vec{m}+\\vec{d}+\\vec{n}$.\n乘方，得\n$\\overrightarrow{AB}^2=\\vec{m}^2+\\vec{d}^2+\\vec{n}^2+2\\vec{m}\\cdot\\vec{d}+2\\vec{m}\\cdot\\vec{n}+2\\vec{d}\\cdot\\vec{n}$. (1)\n因为向量$\\vec{d}$垂直于向量$\\vec{m}$和$\\vec{n}$，所以$\\vec{m}\\cdot\\vec{d}=\\vec{d}\\cdot\\vec{n}=0$.\n可能有两种情况：\n1) $\\widehat{(\\vec{m},\\vec{n})}=\\varphi$(图130，a)；\n2) $\\widehat{(\\vec{m},\\vec{n})}=180^\\circ-\\varphi$(图130，b).\n在第一种情况下$\\vec{m}\\cdot\\vec{n}=mn\\cos\\varphi$，而在第二种情况下，$\\vec{m}\\cdot\\vec{n}=-mn\\cos\\varphi$.\n在(1)式中代入这些值并开方，得到：\n$|AB|=\\sqrt{m^2+d^2+n^2\\pm2mn\\cos\\varphi}$."
      }
    ],
